  "spec_section": "protocol.md §9.6 + §3.4 + §5.2 + §6.4",
  "description": "Pins protocol::encode_search_index_blob_raw + protocol::decode_search_index_blob byte mapping for the MYS1 vault.search encrypted search-index codec (MYND-29). The inner plaintext is OPAQUE (engine-serialized index + manifest) — no canonical-JSON discipline, unlike vault-prefs. search_index_key = derive_subkey(root_key, SubkeyRole::SearchIndexKey) (role 'search-index-key'); account_number_hash binds via aad_search_index_blob (role 'search-index-blob'). 12 cases: 3 encrypt (empty / small / 1-KB) + 1 decrypt_ok + 2 decrypt_aead_fail (tag-tamper + cross-vault, both non-distinguishing per §6.4) + 6 parse_fail (one per distinguishable pre-decryption structural reject). Cases generated by `cargo test -p protocol --lib emit_vault_search_vectors_for_paste -- --ignored` (in protocol/src/search_blob.rs).",
  "cases": [
    {
      "vector_id": "vault-search/v0.1/encrypt-empty",
      "description": "Encode an empty inner plaintext (fresh vault, no notes indexed). The smallest valid MYS1 blob: 34-byte header + 0-byte ciphertext + 32-byte CTX tag = 66 bytes. ciphertext_len field = 32.",
      "case_kind": "encrypt",
      "input_root_key_hex": "4242424242424242424242424242424242424242424242424242424242424242",
      "input_account_number_hash_hex": "7c7c7c7c7c7c7c7c7c7c7c7c7c7c7c7c",
      "input_plaintext_hex": "",
      "input_nonce_hex": "999999999999999999999999999999999999999999999999",
      "informational_search_index_key_hex": "24b80d244a8ba48b1f64c94496d91ec7c20c44a3565e79859b18c0ed5553aac9",
      "expected_search_blob_hex": "4d595331010199999999999999999999999999999999999999999999999900000020b1e059f1deb2bc3beedf66a0dcc76f7652c32fc0da4d9215cd4c802c7f03dbc2"
    },
    {
      "vector_id": "vault-search/v0.1/encrypt-small",
