      "vector_id": "vault-search/v0.1/decrypt-tampered-ctx-tag",
      "description": "Take the small blob and flip the final byte (inside the 32-byte CTX commitment tag) via XOR 0xFF. The decoder MUST surface a non-distinguishing CannotDecrypt — the recomputed CTX commitment no longer matches. Same observable outcome as the cross-vault case below (spec §6.4).",
