    },
    {
      "vector_id": "vault-search/v0.1/decrypt-cross-vault-account-hash",
      "description": "Take the intact small blob but decrypt under a DIFFERENT account_number_hash (0x7d×16 instead of 0x7c×16). aad_search_index_blob binds the account hash, so the AAD differs and AEAD verification fails — a blob from vault A cannot be opened against vault B. Collapses to the same CannotDecrypt as the tamper case; ports MUST NOT distinguish the two.",
